OL,3,GNEWSA'We're the football club that
OL,4,Anobody wants to sign for'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We always say, it's the club that
OL,7,Fnobody wants to sign for."
OL,9,FJack Wingate plays for SANDS United
OL,10,FBasingstoke, which was set up to help
OL,11,Fmen support each other through the
OL,12,Ftrauma of baby loss.
OL,14,FThe Hampshire team has more than 50
OL,15,Fmembers who hold weekly training
OL,16,Fsessions and aim to play twice a month.
OL,18,FFounded by Stephen Kelly after he lost
OL,19,Fhis daughter Amelia Grace Kelly in
OL,20,FOctober 2020, it has become a lifeline
OL,21,Fto many men in the area.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
